This directory contains example scripts to compile the test wrapper and
integrate the TCMs.

To run the example scripts as is, first edit scripts/tsmc18.tcl .
Change references to ByteRAM_256RA1SH to match the required TCM
Ram(s). Change the definition of $search_path to point to the the
correct cell, synopsys and ram libraries.

The synthesis script can be run from this directory as follows:

mkdir -p db log report lib
dc_shell-t -f scripts/arm946example_compile.tcl > log/arm946example_compile.log

The mkdir is needed to ensure that the given directories exist as they
are needed by the compile script.
